le  due to the massive drop in demand but  really i think it's quite early to be  able to predict just how quickly  we're all going to be cramming back onto  trains again yeah there's been a shift i  think hasn't there in recent weeks  certainly um anecdotally speaking to  people i know who are now sort of saying  what you're saying really keen to start  getting back to  the office um let's just finish uh with  the front page of the  sunday mirror rachel what a lovely uh  picture there of uh  tom of course captain sir tom uh his  spirit lives on his coffin  wrapped in the in the union jack and  i mean what what a man and what a  send-off today  yeah i think it was an incredibly  dignified and moving  uh send-off today we saw um hannah  ingram or his daughter describe her  father captain  sitter more as a beacon of light and  hope  to the world and i i just think that  that's such a beautiful  sentiment and perfectly captures uh  feelings around the world um towards  towards this incredible man  and obviously sending sympathies to  all his family and loved ones

